  "seoTitle": "KPK Investigates ATR/BPN Ministry Corruption Case",
  "metaDescription": "The Corruption Eradication Commission is actively investigating alleged bribery and irregular land rights issuance within the Indonesian ATR/BPN Ministry.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The KPK is scrutinizing the issuance process of land rights documents, specifically HGB and HGU titles, involving ministry officials.",
